{"3686070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fermi The Radioactive Hodgepodge", "steam_appid": 3686070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything was fine until the nuclear bombardment…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Periodic Kingdom is under attack! Dr. Mendelevil’s mutant army roams the land as toxic waste threatens those who are left. Fortunately, a group of unpaid interns devise a plan to create a hero. Only…they mess up the formula and end up creating FERMI THE RADIOACTIVE HODGEPODGE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s small. He’s radioactive. He makes weird sounds randomly. And he’s our only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 levels across five unique worlds, including the Acid Rainforest and Nuclear Winter Wonderland!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable upgrades like fire belch, drill head, spring tail, and more so you can customize your gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas with new challenges and collectables that will allow you to earn the most powerful upgrades of all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack filled with instruments ranging from electric guitars to sitars to harpsichords to theremins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sly sense of humor that makes this game a blast for kids and adults alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific puns galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of mutant enemies, including batdogs, gigantic two headed racoons, even more gigantic shark-octopuses, and creatures that defy description</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Levels powered by Tyteros Interactive’s own engine</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything was fine until the nuclear bombardment…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Periodic 